<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Day 43 Carousel Gallery — HealthNexus Population Health Workflow Architect</title>
<style>
body{background:#04080f;color:#eef3f8;font-family:'DM Sans',Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:40px 20px;}
h1{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:24px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:6px;}
p.sub{text-align:center;color:#9fb0c3;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:30px;}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:24px;max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto;}
.slide-item{background:#0b1626;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;}
.slide-item img{width:100%;display:block;}
.cap{padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;color:#9fb0c3;text-align:center;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Day 43 / 60 — Population Health &amp; Clinical Decision Intelligence Workflow Architect</h1>
<p class="sub">Carousel gallery, 8 slides, fully offline (images embedded as base64)</p>
<div class="grid">
<div class="slide-item"><img src="data:image/png;base64,"><div class="cap">Slide 1 / 8</div></div>
<div class="slide-item"><img src="data:image/png;base64,"><div class="cap">Slide 2 / 8</div></div>
<div class="slide-item"><img src="data:image/png;base64,"><div class="cap">Slide 3 / 8</div></div>
<div class="slide-item"><img src="data:image/png;base64,"><div class="cap">Slide 4 / 8</div></div>
<div class="slide-item"><img src="data:image/png;base64,"><div class="cap">Slide 5 / 8</div></div>
<div class="slide-item"><img src="data:image/png;base64,"><div class="cap">Slide 6 / 8</div></div>
<div class="slide-item"><img src="data:image/png;base64,"><div class="cap">Slide 7 / 8</div></div>
<div class="slide-item"><img src="data:image/png;base64,"><div class="cap">Slide 8 / 8</div></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
